    <briefdescription>
<para>Standalone audit log chain verifier. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Replays the hash chain in a log file written by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_hash_chain_audit_writer" kindref="compound">HashChainAuditWriter</ref> and reports the first entry where the <computeroutput>prev_hash</computeroutput> field does not match the expected running hash.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_audit_log_verifier_1a9f870f7345e3a11282e2ce22b277e09d" kindref="member">AuditLogVerifier</ref><sp/>verifier;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>verifier.verify_chain(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;data/logs/audit_chain.jsonl&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!result.ok)<sp/>{<sp/>...<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>v1.5.0: Initial implementation (Phase 3 FUTURE_ENHANCEMENTS.md). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
